stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Discovered
    Discovered --> Classified
    Classified --> Unsupported: no lawful adapter/oracle path
    Classified --> RefusalBoundary: intentionally non-engineerable / unsafe
    Classified --> AdapterMissing
    Classified --> CapabilityMissing
    Classified --> AuthorityRequired
    Classified --> DependencyBlocked
    Classified --> ReadyForTrial

    AdapterMissing --> ReadyForTrial: shared adapter repair
    CapabilityMissing --> ReadyForTrial: capability manufactured
    AuthorityRequired --> ReadyForTrial: authority threaded/admitted
    DependencyBlocked --> ReadyForTrial: dependency restored

    ReadyForTrial --> BenchmarkExecuted
    BenchmarkExecuted --> Scored
    Scored --> BelowFrontier
    Scored --> FrontierMatched
    Scored --> SOTASurpassed

    BelowFrontier --> ReadyForTrial: learn + repair
    FrontierMatched --> ReadyForTrial: seek margin / robustness
    SOTASurpassed --> IndependentlyVerified
    IndependentlyVerified --> [*]
